      "desc": "Soukaku has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Northern Wind]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\nNorthern Wind: While in the <color=#FFFFFF>Frosted Banner</color> state, the number of usable enhanced <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attacks</color> and enhanced <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attacks</color> is increased to 12, and also deal 45% more DMG.",
